summary: Contexts: name the work under way, so what is written in it is one label

!! Reference

```
Contexts: name the work under way, so what is written in it is one label

Usage: mf label <COMMAND>

Commands:
  begin  Open a label inside the current context and print it, to export as METAFOLDER_LABEL
  show   Show a label (default: the current context) and the labels it is nested in
  help   Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help
```
